/* 
  Comparing a standard Web Request vs a Web API Request:

  Standard Website Request:
  - Client: Types 'facebook.com' in Chrome
  - Server: Sends back <html><body><h1>Facebook</h1>...</body></html>

  Web API Request:
  - Client: Mobile App fetches 'api.facebook.com/v1/feed'
  - Server: Sends back raw data:
    {
      "posts": [
        { "id": 1, "text": "Hello World", "likes": 5 }
      ]
    }
*/
